---
source: crates/holst-cli/src/table.rs
expression: help_of(line)
---
End the server session and forget the saved login on this machine.
The board cache of the account is removed too.

USAGE
  holst auth logout [flags]

FLAGS
  --local-only   Only forget the saved login here; do not end the server session

INHERITED FLAGS
  --output, --verbose, --base-url, --home, --no-cache, --help   as in `holst -h`

EXAMPLES
  $ holst auth logout
  $ holst auth logout --local-only

LEARN MORE
  Exit codes: `holst help exit-codes`.
